* Source-specific emission upper bounds for Archetype A overlay.
* Activate with: cfg$gms$s56_source_bounds_on <- 1
*
* Format (cs3, comma-delimited):
* dummy,dummy,dummy,value
*
* One row per (year, region, source) combination you want to bound.
* Any (region, source) pair not listed remains unconstrained (+INF).
* Bound units match vm_emissions_reg native units (Tg per yr).
*
* Example rows:
* y2020,BRA,secdforest_vegc,500
* y2025,BRA,secdforest_vegc,450
* y2020,BRA,ent_ferm,200